  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Theresa Barone",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:58:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:58:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good morning. Oh, um, I think I call wrong place. I want the restaurant, the one for lunch pickup. Is this the restaurant?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:58:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, ma'am, this is the City Clerk's office at Newport City Hall. I think you dialed a wrong number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:58:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I am so sorry. So sorry to bother you. My eyes are not good, I push wrong button."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:59:03-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's no bother at all. Do you have the restaurant's number written down somewhere? You might try dialing it again, nice and slow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:59:11-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, I have it here. My daughter put it in my phone, but the text message from her come hours late. Since the storm last weekend, Saturday into Sunday, everything is late. So I write the number on paper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:59:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that sounds like a nuisance. I hope the paper copy works better. Take your time with the digits."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:59:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, you are very kind. Sorry again for the mistake. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:59:35-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Enjoy your lunch."
    }
  ],
